flowchart TB
    accTitle: BlaBla development workflow
    accDescr: The orchestrator recovers relevant intent with status and explain, then opens a bounded task. The worker accepts, implements within scope, records focused evidence and lens assessments, challenges the record and hands back ready. An independent reviewer inspects the diff and evidence and records findings; corrections return through acceptance and renewed evidence. The orchestrator resolves findings, integrates, confirms owner records and closes when current, then runs finish. Optional expert advice enters only at observed eligible checkpoints and has no scope or gate authority.
    plan["ORCHESTRATOR<br/>recover → assign"]
    work["WORKER<br/>accept → implement<br/>check + lenses<br/>challenge → ready"]
    review["INDEPENDENT REVIEW<br/>inspect → record findings"]
    finish["ORCHESTRATOR<br/>resolve → integrate → close<br/>finish: OVERALL GREEN"]
    expert["Optional expert<br/>observed checkpoints only<br/>no scope / gate authority"]
    plan --> work --> review --> finish
    review -. "corrections" .-> work
    finish -. "BLOCKED" .-> plan
    work -. "observed boundary" .-> expert
    expert -. "advice" .-> work
    classDef gate fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#15803d,color:#14532d;
    class finish gate;
